{"id": "DfFrfdkxKQc", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Did you know Ram showed Sita the WHOLE Ramayan from the sky? 🛕✨ How many of these 8 places have YOU visited? Comment the number 👇\n\nAfter the war, Ram flew home from Lanka on the Pushpak Vimana. And as they flew, he pointed down and showed Sita every place where their story happened. Valmiki recorded every stop (Yuddha Kanda, Sarga 123):\n\n🔸 Lanka, where Ravana fell\n🔸 Nala's bridge, built in 5 days\n🔸 The sea where Mainaka rose to rest Hanuman\n🔸 Kishkindha, where Vali fell (and where they waited out 4 months of rain)\n🔸 Rishyamuka and Pampa, where Ram met Sugriva, wept for Sita, and met Shabari\n🔸 Where Jatayu fought for her\n🔸 Panchavati, where Ravana took her\n🔸 The ashrams of Agastya and Atri: 10 years among the sages\n🔸 Chitrakoot, where Bharata begged him to come home and took his sandals\n🔸 The Yamuna, the Ganga, Guha's town… and Ayodhya: \"Bow down to it, Sita.\"\n\nAnd Ram had to hurry. Bharata had sworn to enter the fire if Ram wasn't back when the 14 years ended. On Panchami, with the 14th year complete, they landed at Bharadvaja's ashram, and Hanuman raced ahead to tell Bharata: Ram is home. 🙏\n\nEvery memory in this reel is from our 12-part Ramayan series. Start from Part 1 on our page!\n\n🪓 Our next series, PARSHURAMA, starts soon. Follow @therishikatha so you don't miss it.\n📱 Our live wallpapers + picture books: rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\nSave this for your next trip, and send it to the friend who's from one of these places! 💛\n\n#ramayan #ramayana #jaishriram #shriram #sita #hanuman #ayodhya #ramsetu #hampi #nashik #chitrakoot #prayagraj #pushpakvimana #valmiki #sanatandharma", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1793299534, "like_count": 1671, "comment_count": 14, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1929258098481744a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 51.904, "asr":