3926, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "niks903622", "author_id": "2050963131", "id": "18130990363867722", "text": "1", "timestamp": 1793458878, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "wills.andy.148", "author_id": "52880364199", "id": "18646081462034030", "text": "Before taking the Pushpak vahan of deceased Ravana, did Rama take the permission of Mandodari, the widow of Ravana? Property of husband belongs to the wife.", "timestamp": 1793435626, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "shivnarain", "author_id": "54305099", "id": "18414358840095745", "text": "@therishikatha why haven’t you mentioned Bhadrachalam actually revered as Swayambhu (self-manifested or self-originated)", "timestamp": 1793353566, "like_count": 3}, {"author": "ihinoak", "author_id": "45401526515", "id": "17911063884483653", "text": "❤️", "timestamp": 1793347648, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "neelasaraswate_namah", "author_id": "69784502410", "id": "17988265146083635", "text": "🙌", "timestamp": 1793300284, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "traffic_tadka", "author_id": "28864295884", "id": "18137976028657179", "text": "What a beautiful recap to Ramayan Series 😍", "timestamp": 1793299883, "like_count": 9}, {"author": "therishikatha", "author_id": "22569163881", "id": "18114975959152312", "text": "How many did you get? 🙏 The 8 on the map: 1 Sri Lanka · 2 Rameswaram · 3 Hampi (Kishkindha) · 4 Nashik (Panchavati) · 5 Chitrakoot · 6 Prayagraj · 7 Shringverpur · 8 Ayodhya. Valmiki names the places; these are their traditional sites.\n\nIs your town on Ram's route?", "timestamp": 1793299580, "like_count": 2}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfFrfdkxKQc/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfFrfdkxKQc", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/878759521_18130423246755882_3249855761427662585_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAxODgwOTUyMDU1NzE3MTc0MA%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5